//RS /// `file_handle_rust_type`/`net_handle_rust_type` are separate functions
//RS /// rather than folded into `core_rust_type_name` (that table's caller always
//RS /// prepends `jet_std::`). `HVar`/`VVar`/`LengthVar` all erase to the SAME
//RS /// runtime type (`jet_layout::LinExpr`) — the axis distinction is
//RS /// compile-time-only (sema, GATE 1/2), nothing to represent at runtime.
